From 26f3b9db5196e69b17e82e0c65809ddf408c8af5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "gastown.slit (polecat)" <polecat-gastown.slit@soundit.local>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 23:10:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(billing): cover backup storage tier billing
 (psa-cvh)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Unit (no DB): Sku::priceForStorageGb() tier selection — inclusive
  boundaries, unbounded catch-all, exceed-all-with-no-catch-all -> top
  rate, no-tiers -> null, order-independent.
- Feature: resolveQuantity(PerBackupStorageGb) client-wide and
  contract-scoped; excludes inactive/soft-deleted assets and null usage.
- Feature: previewInvoice prices a backup line at the matching tier and
  falls back to the flat price when the SKU has no tiers. previewInvoice
  (not generateInvoice) is used deliberately: it exercises the same
  quantity/price/quantity_source path without the invoice-number query,
  whose MySQL-only SUBSTRING is unrunnable on the sqlite test DB
  (tracked separately for end-to-end generateInvoice coverage).
- Feature: SKU editor renders the tier editor + prefilled rows and
  persists/replaces/clears tiers.
